## RAM-only staging and execution

Push SquashFS to /run/lab/mesa-smoke.squashfs; create /run/mesa and /run/lab/tmp.
Mount it with `mount -t squashfs -o loop,ro ... /run/mesa`.
Bind /dev, /proc and /sys onto the corresponding chroot directories.
Bind /run/lab onto /run/mesa/run and /run/lab/tmp onto /run/mesa/tmp.
Verify its hash using `chroot /run/mesa /usr/bin/sha256sum /run/mesa-smoke.squashfs`.
The device-side hash matched the host hash above. No internal filesystem is involved.

Fixtures held constant: GPU device power/control=on (via
/sys/class/drm/renderD128/device/power/control), FD_MESA_DEBUG=inorder,
EGL_PLATFORM=surfaceless, LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/mesa/lib.
MESA_SHADER_CACHE_DISABLE=true for the dEQP runs, to avoid the read-only root cache path.
There is no desktop/compositor requirement. Mesa rendering uses the real render node.

